    "created_at": "2023-02-27T22:51:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-27T22:51:31Z",
    "body": "The reason I mention it is that chrome follows image rotation settings* in imageBitmaps created from Video elements while Firefox doesn't. They also diverge when creating WebGL textures directly from Video elements.\r\n\r\nNot EXIF but have the same effect.\r\n\r\n",
