    "created_at": "2023-12-11T22:30:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-12-11T22:33:11Z",
    "body": "As of [Safari 17.2](https://webkit.org/blog/14787/webkit-features-in-safari-17-2/#:~:text=Image%20Orientation) the [change from `none` to `from-image`](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8710) seems to be implemented in Chromium/Gecko/WebKit. I think we should land this (but it needs a rebase).\r\n\r\nI added a \"needs tests\" label in May, but I don't recall why. Tests are referenced above. Are more tests needed?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
